{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tag along in this epic dungeon busting idler!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try and complete the magical dungeon that revives you letting you fail it again (and again, and ag...). It's not your typical idler you'll have to abuse your enemies weaknesses and choose the right path for the right rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your skills and equipment that you obtain during your adventure to defeat the hordes of brutal enemies, but worry not, when you lose (and i guarantee you will) you will have the chance to try again ... at the beginning ... without your equipment ... but hey you'll still have your skills so no worries there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026520?t=1771194315","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026520/763011bac7f39f77d58a5af1e2fd8cf3162b188f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771194315","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026520/6080606fc66c395171762f1fc6c93edd8ba4bb79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771194315","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026520/6080606fc66c395171762f1fc6c93edd8ba4bb79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771194315","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tag along in this epic dungeon busting idler!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try and complete the magical dungeon that revives you letting you fail it again (and again, and ag...). It's not your typical idler you'll have to abuse your enemies weaknesses and choose the right path for the right rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your skills and equipment that you obtain during your adv